            <ArticleTitle>Fibromyalgia and its relation to chronic fatigue syndrome, viral illness and immune abnormalities.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>91-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fibromyalgia and chronic fatigue syndrome have similar clinical and demographic features. We found that most patients with chronic fatigue syndrome have a tender point examination similar to patients with fibromyalgia. Similar pathophysiologic mechanisms are also being explored in each syndrome, including a potential role for viral induced immune dysfunction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
